escription":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains scenes with blood, murders, images of corpses. The game may also contain themes related to survival in extreme conditions, including hunger, despair. Alcohol consumption."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soviet Survival</strong> is an isometric, open-world survival game where you must find your place in the ruined Soviet Union.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive in this merciless new reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Survive at all costs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt or take risks in the ruins of the old world, getting rare supplies. The choice is yours: hide and build or take risks in search of a better life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Cooperative mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with friends. Together, survivors are stronger, but you can't trust everyone...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Leveling and loot system</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with skills and Soviet equipment. From a sawed-off shotgun to an AK-47 - choose a weapon and survival style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Crafting and construction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create everything from homemade weapons to fortified shelters. Strengthen your positions and defend yourself from threats, be it hungry beasts, mutants or marauders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Realistic fight for life</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst and radioactive zones \u2013 even without mutants and bandits, this world will try to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you hold out in a world where hope is a scarce commodity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soviet Survival is your story in a harsh alternative reality. Are you ready to fight?</p>","developers":["Hunt Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603940/42c18a6f9406b943a6a353254c76d800e24d2533/header.jpg?t=1770209194","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603940/6806069/979f7a6b8768e76e8b3997d77788510c53d9f7b8/1756902741/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756903676","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603940/6806069/979f7a6b8768e76e8b3997d77788510c53d9f7b8/1756902741/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756903676","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3603940/6806069/979f7a6b8768e76e8b3997d77788510c53d9f7b8/1756902741/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756903676","id":257192619,"name":"Soviet Survival 0.0.9","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192619/1e359c10be3f0f7efad7c5420fab655efaba6404/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756903676"}],"name":"Soviet Survival","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Soviet Survival - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99</span> $1.49 USD","packageid":1271028,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-70% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":149}],"title":"Buy Soviet Survival"}],"packages":[1271028],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min